  "aboutTitle": "About Maddie",
  "aboutP1": "I'm Maddie, an autistic developer who cares, maybe a little too much, about getting the small things right.",
  "aboutP2": "I'm a big believer in privacy. The keys that protect your accounts are about as personal as data gets, so Tanooki Auth keeps them encrypted on your own device. No account, no ads, no tracking, and nothing is ever sent to me.",
  "aboutP3": "Tanooki Auth is free, and I want it to stay that way. Your support is what lets me keep making free privacy apps like this one. If Tanooki Auth suits you, the rest might too — they're at madilynthomas.com.",
  "aboutP4": "So, from me to you: thank you. You're not just using an app — you're making this whole way of living possible.",
