  "addFromGoogle": "Move from Google Authenticator",
  "addFromGoogleSteps": "On the device with Google Authenticator:\n\n1. Open Google Authenticator.\n2. Tap the menu (☰ or ⋮), then \"Transfer accounts\", then \"Export accounts\".\n3. Pick the accounts and tap Next. It shows a QR code.\n\nThen scan that QR code here. If it shows several QR codes, scan each one.",
