  "helpNew030a": "Step-by-step guides for turning on 2FA at 40 popular sites. When you add or edit an account we have a guide for, there's a link to it.",
  "helpNew030b": "A short welcome tour the first time you open the app. See it again in Settings > Help.",
  "helpNew030c": "Send feedback from Settings > Help. It never includes your accounts or codes.",
  "helpNew030d": "This What's new page.",
  "helpNew030e": "Import from Apple Passwords, and move your accounts to Aegis, 2FAS or Google Authenticator.",
  "helpNew030f": "Steam Guard codes, counter-based codes with a \"Next code\" button, and advanced code settings with a live preview.",
  "helpNew030g": "Folders, select many accounts at once, sort A to Z or by recently used, and \"Tidy account names\".",
  "helpNew030h": "Show an account's QR code (after Face ID or your passcode) to move it to another device.",
  "helpNew030i": "Unlock with a security key such as a YubiKey (Premium), on newer iPhones, Macs and Windows PCs.",
  "helpNew030j": "\"Ask first\" accounts that need Face ID or your passcode before showing the code, and travel mode to hide chosen accounts (Premium).",
  "helpNew030k": "Activity history (Premium), \"Codes not working?\" clock check, Test a backup, lock on sleep, and backup reminders.",
  "helpNew030l": "Emergency access: let someone you trust ask for your accounts, with days for you to say no.",
  "helpNew030m": "Spotlight search, a copied-code Live Activity and a watch face complication (Premium), Copy on open, and Mac \"Clear after one paste\".",
  "helpNew030n": "Countdown styles, a color or emoji for each account, Read aloud, an easy-to-read font, and better screen reader support.",
  "helpNew030o": "A wide layout for big windows, and seasonal Premium icons.",
  "helpNew030p": "Buy Premium inside the app on iPhone and Android, gift it, and invite friends.",
  "helpNew030q": "Team vault for sharing codes with up to 10 people. The team plan itself is coming soon.",
  "helpNew030r": "The Family plan is coming soon.",
  "helpNew030s": "The desktop app now runs on Linux too. Linux downloads are coming soon.",
  "helpNew020a": "Sync between your devices, phone link for the browser extension, and secure sharing of one account.",
  "helpNew020b": "Passcode, auto-lock, panic wipe, decoy passcode, screenshot blocking, check-up and breach alerts.",
  "helpNew020c": "Widgets, Apple Watch and Wear OS apps, the Mac menu bar and Windows tray, and automatic encrypted backups (Premium).",
  "helpNew020d": "Importers for Aegis, 2FAS, Authy, Bitwarden and 1Password, plus favorites, tags, notes, recovery codes and Trash.",
  "helpNew010a": "The first version: scan or paste accounts, see codes, encrypted backups, and the browser extension.",
